+
+## Model context metadata
+
+Each model object returned by `GET /v1/models` and `GET /v1/models/{id}` includes
+`max_model_len`, the running server's exact per-sequence logical context ceiling from
+`--max-context`. Clients can use this value to budget input and reserve response tokens within
+the same context window. It reflects the active server configuration and may be lower than the
+checkpoint's nominal context size.
+
+For example, the SM89 launcher sets `--max-context 65536`, so both endpoints advertise
+`"max_model_len": 65536` for `qwen3.8-27b-sm89`.
 
